mlx-drunet-swift
================

Port code: MIT (this repository).

Upstream model and weights
--------------------------
DPIR / DRUNet — https://github.com/cszn/DPIR
Zhang et al., "Plug-and-Play Image Restoration with Deep Denoiser Prior",
IEEE TPAMI 2021.

License: MIT. See LICENSE-upstream.

Weights are published first-party by the same author in the cszn/KAIR release
v1.0 (https://github.com/cszn/KAIR/releases/tag/v1.0), whose LICENSE is MIT.

NOTE: third-party mirrors exist on Hugging Face (deepinv/drunet) carrying a
bsd-3-clause tag. That is the DeepInverse *library's* licence applied across
their org and does not reflect this model's upstream MIT. This port does not
use those mirrors.
